      "timestamp_raw": "May 11, 2023 12:21:09 GMT -5",
      "body_html": "I lost count, but the was light frost at minimum 120 nights this past winter.  I think the freeze has to be pretty significant to cause the translucence.<br/><br/>There's only one tiny little trap that opened so far this spring, here it is!  Pics taken 5/11/23:<br/><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/52889971523_c343efca63_c.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/52889971453_2187a39790_c.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/52888947452_efeedda6e3_c.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/>",
